        "raw": "{\"course\": \"AK\", \"acip\": \"CHOS NGAN PA DANG, MI DGE BA'I RTZA BA LAS BZLOG PA DANG,\", \"wylie\": \"chos ngan pa dang, mi dge ba'i rtsa ba las bzlog pa dang\", \"english\": \"Deciding not to follow ways of thought that aren't good. Turning away from actions which are the very foundation of bad karma.\"}"
